    },
    "body": "This PR removes direct access to process-wide state from `ExternalSignerScriptPubKeyMan`.\r\n\r\nInstead of reading `gArgs`/`Params()` from the `SPKM`, the wallet load/setup path now reads the external signer command and chain once, stores them on `CWallet`, and passes the narrow values into the external signer SPKM.\r\n\r\nThis keeps argument and chain selection at the wallet boundary and makes the SPKM less coupled to global state.",
    "labels": [
      {
        "id": 149424,
        "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxNDk0MjQ=",
