      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/35429\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/35429.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/35429#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#35444](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35444) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35444.svg\"></sub> (wallet: make descriptor SPKM mutex non-recursive by w0xlt)\n* [#33112](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/33112.svg\"></sub> (wallet: relax external_signer flag constraints by Sjors)\n* [#31260](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/31260) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/31260.svg\"></sub> (scripted-diff: Type-safe settings retrieval by ryanofsky)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
